# Telephony glue. The STT / TTS / VAD / turn-classifier engines all come from the
# audio package — with the [localmodels] extra (on-box Silero VAD + Smart Turn
# ONNX/transformers) since the phone pipeline runs them locally. `uv pip compile`
# pins the transitive deps below. Compile + install run from the repo root so
# `./audio` resolves (dev `oto-dock/`, Docker `/app`, bare-metal `/opt/otodock`).
-e ./audio[localmodels]
